#: ../../source/docs/modules/messagerate.rst:3
#: f5786a541f3c4c6cb763a13980036d13
msgid "Set Message Rate"
msgstr "设置消息速率"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/messagerate.rst:9
#: 8534d5302b7c4579b4bfaf281b032811
msgid ""
"The messagerate module allows the user to specify the rate of individual "
"MAVlink messages sent from the flight controller. This will override any "
"requested stream rates"
msgstr "messagerate 模块允许用户指定飞控发送的各 MAVLink 消息的速率，将覆盖任何已请求的数据流速率"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/messagerate.rst:13
#: 32d7da8ff87a49a8a95b80b35465c051
msgid "Usage: ``messagerate <status | reset | set(msg)(rate) | get(msg)>``"
msgstr "用法：``messagerate <status | reset | set(msg)(rate) | get(msg)>``"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/messagerate.rst:15
#: 2fee9853684d48e897a8833aac048a9c
msgid "``status``: list current message rates"
msgstr "``status``：列出当前消息速率"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/messagerate.rst:16
#: b5848bef58aa43a08554b5d06a39f8cf
msgid "``reset``: reset all message rates to defaults."
msgstr "``reset``：将所有消息速率重置为默认值。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/messagerate.rst:17
#: 475380c291bb4375aaf50d568bd7fe91
msgid "``set msg rate``: set the message ``msg`` to rate ``rate``"
msgstr "``set msg rate``：将消息 ``msg`` 的速率设为 ``rate``"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/messagerate.rst:18
#: 6cd096cdded246d9972a77f1a30f830f
msgid "``get msg``: Get the message ``msg`` rate"
msgstr "``get msg``：获取消息 ``msg`` 的速率"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/messagerate.rst:20
#: 30143093d72e4c5c9c11aced94acb328
msgid "For example, to set the HEARTBEAT MAVLink message rate to 10Hz:"
msgstr "例如，将 HEARTBEAT MAVLink 消息速率设为 10Hz："
